--- a/docs/O10.md
+++ b/docs/O10.md
@@ -229,3 +229,20 @@ EUNSUPPORTED in M2. Component/native-model results retain their individual
 scope and do not establish Linux guest restart, interrupted ext4/APK recovery,
 or the full M2 gate. The native chosen-token/fid qualification witness and live
 M2 acceptance remain pending.
+
+### Unqualified M2 native store witness
+
+Qualification builds expose a fixed diagnostic mailbox operation11, separate
+from O10. Its action word at0x6d000118 accepts only capture or check; callers
+cannot supply a grant, session, fid or namespace path. Its320KiB output region
+0x6d0b0000..0x6d0fffff lies outside both guest stage-2 RAM maps.
+Production builds return EUNSUPPORTED and clear any diagnostic token/frame data.
+
+Capture obtains opaque sessions from the actual Linux virtio9P and Plan9 UART
+frontends, then retains every fid of those bindings (at most512 combined).
+Check uses the old Linux binding for raw Tstat requests and requires numeric
+9P2000.u ESTALE116; Plan9 retains its session, transport generation and complete
+fid/object-generation/mode tuples. Raw QID identity is checked by the gate;
+file content, sizes and QID versions may advance. This observer is
+qualification evidence only and confers no new guest authority. Native host
+models and source compilation do not qualify the live M2 restart gate.
